sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User<br/>request
    participant R as FastAPI<br/>router
    participant SQL as SQLLM<br/>SELECT guard
    participant DB as DB<br/>read evidence
    participant WF as Worker<br/>Airflow job
    participant LG as LangGraph<br/>review
    participant ST as Status<br/>artifact
    U->>R: ask status evidence or action
    alt quick answer
      R-->>U: return cached contract answer
    else read only evidence
      R->>SQL: build constrained query
      SQL->>DB: SELECT whitelisted tables
      DB-->>R: return evidence rows
      R-->>U: answer with citations
    else background job
      R->>WF: register ops api job
      WF->>ST: publish artifact status
      ST-->>U: expose status and download
    else risky action
      R->>LG: create approval review request
      LG->>ST: write review artifact
      ST-->>U: return approval status
    end
